0f8bd", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-401a378fb24a70838871cb52", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/e409a4a70442368b790385b2c81f47242acf713cbcb0c9247bfd5147769f5153.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "e409a4a70442368b790385b2c81f47242acf713cbcb0c9247bfd5147769f5153", "user_turn_count": 2, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 381], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "84c0cefb932096561926de42b1774ed0a31dfe86ecff1724d551815888e2b55f", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 281], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "5d02fb867b2792508949229d8db1020e065287f5ebe070d61a1b44168d40b92f", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "*附件顺序（原消息）：解析图 `assets/Q01_57687_solution.png`；题目图 `assets/Q01_57687_question.png`。*\n\n这道题我完全忘记怎么做了。\n\n我记得一元函数求导，导数是否存在就看它的导数定义，看它的导数定义跟它直接求导得出来的是不是一样的。那这个多元函数看它导数存在，我真忘记怎么做了。这道题我对这个多元函数进行直接求导，也就是 $f(x, y)$ 对 $x$ 求偏导，等于：\n\n$$\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} \\cdot \\sqrt{1 + x^2 + y^2}}$$\n\n对 $y$ 求偏导的话，把分子换成 $y$ 就好了。\n\n那这个东西我怎么确认它的导数是否相等？这道题的解题逻辑是什么样子的？我有点忘记怎么评判它是否存在了。\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"m002\"></a>"}